    </span><span><span class="hljs-operator">|</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">Nest</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">E</span></span><span><span class="hljs-operator">,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">E</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span></span><span>           </span><span><span class="hljs-operator">//</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">bubble</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">inside</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">bubble</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span></span><span><span class="hljs-variable">scope</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">nesting</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="726" data-end="737"><strong data-start="726" data-end="735">Notes</strong></p>
<ul data-start="738" data-end="1030">
<li data-start="738" data-end="818">
<p data-start="740" data-end="818"><code data-start="740" data-end="751">Sphere(E)</code> = like entering parentheses <code data-start="780" data-end="785">(E)</code> in arithmetic or lambda terms.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="819" data-end="896">
<p data-start="821" data-end="896"><code data-start="821" data-end="835">Merge(E1,E2)</code> = parallel composition (like juxtaposition in λ-calculus).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="897" data-end="959">
<p data-start="899" data-end="959"><code data-start="899" data-end="911">Pop(E1,E2)</code> = application / reduction: E1 “pops into” E2.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="960" data-end="1030">
<p data-start="962" data-end="1030"><code data-start="962" data-end="975">Nest(E1,E2)</code> = explicit scoping, like <code data-start="1001" data-end="1012">(E1 (E2))</code> in Lisp/Racket.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1032" data-end="1035">
<h2 data-start="1037" data-end="1070">Operational Semantics (sketch)</h2>
<ol data-start="1072" data-end="1748">
<li data-start="1072" data-end="1224">
<p data-start="1075" data-end="1097"><strong data-start="1075" data-end="1095">Sphere formation</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Sphere</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇝</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sphere}(E) \;\leadsto\; E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel amsrm">⇝</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1148" data-end="1224">(a bubble without interaction is transparent; only when popped does it act).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1226" data-end="1401">
<p data-start="1229" data-end="1252"><strong data-start="1229" data-end="1236">Pop</strong> (application)</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pop</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Sphere</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇝</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Pop}(\text{Sphere}(E_1),E_2) \;\leadsto\; E_1[E_2/x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel amsrm">⇝</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1330" data-end="1401">i.e. treat a bubble as a function expecting input; popping substitutes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1403" data-end="1586">
<p data-start="1406" data-end="1440"><strong data-start="1406" data-end="1415">Merge</strong> (parallel composition)</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Merge</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇝</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Merge}(E_1,E_2) \;\leadsto\; \langle E_1,E_2 \rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Merge</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel amsrm">⇝</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">⟨</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1518" data-end="1586">keep both active in a workspace (like conjunction or superposition).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1588" data-end="1748">
<p data-start="1591" data-end="1601"><strong data-start="1591" data-end="1599">Nest</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Nest</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇝</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Sphere</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Nest}(E_1,E_2) \;\leadsto\; \text{Sphere}(E_1(E_2))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Nest</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel amsrm">⇝</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1678" data-end="1748">— explicit scope creation, ensures evaluation is delayed until popped.</p>
</li>
</ol>
