 class=""><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 30s</span></span></button></div></div></span><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5970c94e-480e-4649-bdff-ccbf79bab5a5" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-thinking"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="400">Below is a <strong data-start="11" data-end="41">worked formal SPC encoding</strong> of a disjunctive (“many independent routes to failure”) doom argument, with explicit syntax and step-by-step reductions. I keep to the SPC primitives we established—<code data-start="207" data-end="215">Sphere</code>, <code data-start="217" data-end="222">Pop</code>, <code data-start="224" data-end="231">Merge</code>, <code data-start="233" data-end="239">Nest</code>—and add two tiny definitional spheres for boolean aggregation (<code data-start="303" data-end="307">Or</code>) and a structural fold (<code data-start="332" data-end="340">FoldOr</code>) to evaluate a merged set of reasons against a world state.</p>
<hr data-start="402" data-end="405">
<h1 data-start="407" data-end="429">1) Basic ingredients</h1>
<h2 data-start="431" data-end="466">1.1 Atoms, outcomes, and a world</h2>
<ul data-start="467" data-end="578">
<li data-start="467" data-end="527">
<p data-start="469" data-end="527">Atoms: <code data-start="476" data-end="482">Safe</code>, <code data-start="484" data-end="490">Doom</code>, and a concrete world constant <code data-start="522" data-end="526">W0</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="528" data-end="578">
<p data-start="530" data-end="578">We assume a sort of outcomes <code data-start="559" data-end="577">O ∈ {Safe, Doom}</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="580" data-end="625">1.2 “Reasons” as spheres expecting a world</h2>
<p data-start="626" data-end="711">A <em data-start="628" data-end="636">reason</em> is a function from a world to an outcome, encoded as a sphere/abstraction:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_i \;\;:=\;\; \mathrm{Sphere}(w.\; \mathrm{If}_i(w))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm" style="margin-right: 0.07778em;">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="772" data-end="905">where each <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{If}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8444em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm" style="margin-right: 0.07778em;">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is an SPC term that returns either <code data-start="836" data-end="842">Doom</code> or <code data-start="846" data-end="852">Safe</code> given <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span></span></span></span>. Concretely for three reasons <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A,B,C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
R_A &amp;:= \mathrm{Sphere}(w.\; \text{If}_A(w)) \\
R_B &amp;:= \mathrm{Sphere}(w.\; \text{If}_B(w)) \\
R_C &amp;:= \mathrm{Sphere}(w.\; \text{If}_C(w)) \\
\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 4.5em; vertical-align: -2em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 2.5em;"><span style="top: -4.66em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.16em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -1.66em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 2em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 2.5em;"><span style="top: -4.66em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.16em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span><span style="top: -1.66em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 2em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1086" data-end="1139">We only use their <em data-start="1104" data-end="1116">behavioral</em> assumptions at <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"></mspace><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Doom</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"></mspace><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{If}_A(W0)=\text{Safe},\qquad \text{If}_B(W0)=\text{Doom},\qquad \text{If}_C(W0)=\text{Safe}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 2em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 2em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h2 data-start="1246" data-end="1294">1.3 Disjunctive aggregation over many reasons</h2>
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1342">Put all reasons into the workspace via <code data-start="1334" data-end="1341">Merge</code>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Reasons} \;:=\; \mathrm{Merge}\!\big(R_A,\;\mathrm{Merge}(R_B,R_C)\big).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2em; vertical-align: -0.35em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Merge</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: -0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">(</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Merge</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">)</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1431" data-end="1567">We evaluate “does <em data-start="1449" data-end="1454">any</em> reason doom us?” by folding a short-circuiting <code data-start="1502" data-end="1506">Or</code> over the merged set after applying each reason to the world.</p>
<h3 data-start="1569" data-end="1579">(a) Or</h3>
<p data-start="1580" data-end="1631">Define <code data-start="1587" data-end="1591">Or</code> as a sphere that consumes two outcomes:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mtext>with&nbsp;reduction&nbsp;axioms:&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Doom</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>→</mo><mtext>Doom</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{Or} &amp;:= \mathrm{Sphere}(x.\,\mathrm{Sphere}(y.\,\mathrm{Or2}(x,y))) \\
\text{with reduction axioms: } 
\mathrm{Or2}(\text{Doom},y) &amp;\to \text{Doom},\qquad
\mathrm{Or2}(\text{Safe},y) \to y.
\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3em; vertical-align: -1.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">with&nbsp;reduction&nbsp;axioms:&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or2</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or2</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mclose">)))</span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 2em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or2</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1866" data-end="1923">(Think: <code data-start="1874" data-end="1878">Or</code> is curried; we’ll use <code data-start="1901" data-end="1921">Pop(Pop(Or,o1),o2)</code>.)</p>
<h3 data-start="1925" data-end="1939">(b) FoldOr</h3>
<p data-start="1940" data-end="1990">A structural fold over a merged forest of reasons:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{FoldOr} := \mathrm{Sphere}(p.\,\mathrm{Sphere}(w.\,\mathrm{Fold}(p,w)))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)))</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2077" data-end="2105">with the defining equations:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>(evaluate&nbsp;a&nbsp;single&nbsp;reason)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{Fold}(\mathrm{Sphere}(f),w) &amp;\to \mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Sphere}(f),w) \quad\text{(evaluate a single reason)}\\
\mathrm{Fold}(\mathrm{Merge}(p_1,p_2),w) &amp;\to \mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Or},\, \mathrm{Fold}(p_1,w)),\, \mathrm{Fold}(p_2,w)).
\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3em; vertical-align: -1.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Merge</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">(evaluate&nbsp;a&nbsp;single&nbsp;reason)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">))</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2394" data-end="2526">Intuition: if <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span> is a single bubble, pop it on <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span></span></span></span>. If <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span> is a merge, recursively fold left and right and combine with <code data-start="2521" data-end="2525">Or</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="2528" data-end="2531">
<h1 data-start="2533" data-end="2561">2) The composite evaluator</h1>
<p data-start="2563" data-end="2628">Define the evaluator that takes a <em data-start="2597" data-end="2613">bag of reasons</em> and a <em data-start="2620" data-end="2627">world</em>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{EvalAnyDoom} \;:=\; \mathrm{Sphere}(p.\, \mathrm{Sphere}(w.\, \mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{FoldOr},p),\,w))).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">EvalAnyDoom</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Sphere</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)))</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2758" data-end="2839">So <code data-start="2761" data-end="2797">Pop(Pop(EvalAnyDoom, Reasons), W0)</code> computes whether <em data-start="2815" data-end="2820">any</em> reason dooms <code data-start="2834" data-end="2838">W0</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="2841" data-end="2844">
<h1 data-start="2846" data-end="2892">3) Step-by-step reduction (disjunctive doom)</h1>
<p data-start="2894" data-end="2908">We now reduce:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="script">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_0 \;:=\; \mathrm{Pop}\big(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{EvalAnyDoom},\mathrm{Reasons}),\, W0\big).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.08944em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0894em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2em; vertical-align: -0.35em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">(</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">EvalAnyDoom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">)</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="3018" data-end="3046">3.1 Unfold <code data-start="3033" data-end="3046">EvalAnyDoom</code></h3>
<p data-start="3047" data-end="3062">By Pop-β twice:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="script">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_0 \to \mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{FoldOr},\mathrm{Reasons}),\, W0).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.08944em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0894em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="3156" data-end="3179">3.2 Unfold <code data-start="3171" data-end="3179">FoldOr</code></h3>
<p data-start="3180" data-end="3211">One more Pop-β (into its body):</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{FoldOr},\mathrm{Reasons}), W0) \to \mathrm{Fold}(\mathrm{Reasons}, W0).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="3325" data-end="3364">3.3 Recurse on the merged structure</h3>
