argin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4580" data-end="4617">(by the <code data-start="4588" data-end="4609">Or2(Doom, y) → Doom</code> axiom).</p>
<h3 data-start="4619" data-end="4662">3.6 Bubble up the Doom via the outer Or</h3>
<p data-start="4663" data-end="4669">We had</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></munder><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Pop}\big(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Or}, \text{Safe}), \,\underline{\mathrm{Fold}(\mathrm{Merge}(R_B,R_C),W0)}\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.3em; vertical-align: -0.45em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">(</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord underline"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.75em;"><span style="top: -2.59em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="underline-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Merge</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.45em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4794" data-end="4847">and the underlined subterm has reduced to <code data-start="4836" data-end="4842">Doom</code>. So:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>Doom</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>Doom</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to \mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Or}, \text{Safe}), \text{Doom})
\to \text{Doom}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Doom</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4940" data-end="4966">(using <code data-start="4947" data-end="4964">Or2(Safe,y) → y</code>).</p>
<p data-start="4968" data-end="5200"><strong data-start="4968" data-end="4979">Result:</strong> the whole evaluation reduces to <code data-start="5012" data-end="5018">Doom</code>.<br data-start="5019" data-end="5022">
Interpretation: even though reason <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> failed (returned <code data-start="5080" data-end="5086">Safe</code>) and <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span> failed, reason <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span> succeeded in producing doom; the disjunctive aggregator short-circuits to <code data-start="5193" data-end="5199">Doom</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="5202" data-end="5205">
<h1 data-start="5207" data-end="5242">4) Control case: all reasons safe</h1>
<p data-start="5244" data-end="5397">If, counterfactually, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{If}_A(W0)=\text{Safe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{If}_B(W0)=\text{Safe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>If</mtext><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{If}_C(W0)=\text{Safe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">If</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span></span></span></span>, then the same derivation yields:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Fold}(R_A,W0)\to \text{Safe},\quad
\mathrm{Fold}(R_B,W0)\to \text{Safe},\quad
\mathrm{Fold}(R_C,W0)\to \text{Safe},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Fold</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5528" data-end="5593">and <code data-start="5532" data-end="5536">Or</code> of <code data-start="5540" data-end="5546">Safe</code> with <code data-start="5552" data-end="5558">Safe</code> reduces to <code data-start="5570" data-end="5576">Safe</code> at each step, so</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Safe</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{Pop}(\mathrm{EvalAnyDoom},\mathrm{Reasons}),W0) \;\to\; \text{Safe}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Pop</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">EvalAnyDoom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Reasons</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Safe</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="5691" data-end="5694">
<h1 data-start="5696" data-end="5737">5) Structural observations and variants</h1>
<ol data-start="5739" data-end="6759">
<li data-start="5739" data-end="5907">
<p data-start="5742" data-end="5907"><strong data-start="5742" data-end="5777">Extensibility to <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span> reasons.</strong><br data-start="5777" data-end="5780">
<code data-start="5783" data-end="5790">Merge</code> is associative/commutative (up to structural congruence), so <code data-start="5852" data-end="5860">FoldOr</code> reduces any finite multiset of reason spheres.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5909" data-end="6182">
<p data-start="5912" data-end="6182"><strong data-start="5912" data-end="5940">Short-circuit execution.</strong><br data-start="5940" data-end="5943">
If you prefer <em data-start="5960" data-end="5978">lazy disjunction</em>, you can refine <code data-start="5995" data-end="6003">FoldOr</code> to reduce the left branch first and skip the right branch when left is <code data-start="6075" data-end="6081">Doom</code>. That refinement is a strategy choice (evaluation contexts) and does not change extensional meaning.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6184" data-end="6484">
<p data-start="6187" data-end="6244"><strong data-start="6187" data-end="6206">Typing (brief).</strong><br data-start="6206" data-end="6209">
With a simple type discipline:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">F</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_i : W \to O,\quad \mathrm{Or}: O \to O \to O,\quad \mathrm{FoldOr} : \mathsf{Forest}(W\to O) \to W \to O,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Or</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Forest</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="6371" data-end="6484">and <code data-start="6375" data-end="6426">EvalAnyDoom : \mathsf{Forest}(W\to O) \to W \to O</code>. Subject reduction holds by the usual substitution lemma.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6486" data-end="6759">
<p data-start="6489" data-end="6759"><strong data-start="6489" data-end="6516">Measure-theoretic echo.</strong><br data-start="6516" data-end="6519">
The SPC derivation mirrors the earlier “entropy as attack surface” point: adding more <code data-start="6608" data-end="6613">R_i</code> increases the arity of <code data-start="6637" data-end="6644">Merge</code>, and <code data-start="6650" data-end="6658">FoldOr</code> gives a monotone map where additional <code data-start="6697" data-end="6703">Doom</code>-capable reasons can only move the result toward <code data-start="6752" data-end="6758">Doom</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="6761" data-end="6764">
<p data-start="6766" data-end="7119" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you’d like, I can give a second worked reduction where <strong data-start="6824" data-end="6838">mitigation</strong> removes or retargets a single reason (e.g., replacing <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> by a patched <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant="normal" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">′</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_B'</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0272em; vertical-align: -0.2753em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7519em;"><span style="top: -2.4247em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2753em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> that returns <code data-start="6936" data-end="6942">Safe</code> on <code data-start="6946" data-end="6950">W0</code>) and show that the overall evaluation still returns <code data-start="7003" data-end="7009">Doom</code> unless <em data-start="7017" data-end="7022">all</em> dangerous reasons are neutralized—capturing the “you must block every channel” intuition in SPC.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-