 class="" data-state="closed"><div class="relative w-full text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class=""><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 15s</span></span></button></div></div></span><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5a4bdb9e-2663-4a0c-827e-27cc4b033276" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-thinking"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="551">Below is a <strong data-start="11" data-end="29">dependent-type</strong> extension of Spherepop Calculus (SPC) into a <strong data-start="75" data-end="110">Calculus-of-Constructions–style</strong> core. Spheres become Π-abstractions (dependent functions), <code data-start="170" data-end="177">Merge</code> becomes Σ-types (dependent pairs), <code data-start="213" data-end="218">Pop</code> is application, and <code data-start="239" data-end="245">Nest</code> is syntactic sugar. I then layer in a typed probabilistic fragment (<code data-start="314" data-end="320">Dist</code>) so that <strong data-start="330" data-end="357">world-dependent hazards</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_i(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> can be encoded cleanly, and I state the “independent channels” doom theorem in this setting, plus mitigation-as-program transformations. Everything is self-contained and LaTeX-ready.</p>
<hr data-start="553" data-end="556">
<h1 data-start="558" data-end="595">1. Syntax (terms, types, universes)</h1>
<p data-start="597" data-end="702">We assume a cumulative hierarchy of universes <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Type}_0:\mathsf{Type}_1:\mathsf{Type}_2:\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.313em;"></span><span class="minner">⋯</span></span></span></span>.</p>
