<p data-start="4406" data-end="4440"><strong data-start="4406" data-end="4440">Identification with SPC syntax</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4441" data-end="4635">
<li data-start="4441" data-end="4600">
<p data-start="4443" data-end="4600"><code data-start="4443" data-end="4451">Sphere</code> <strong data-start="4452" data-end="4458">is</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">λ</span></span></span></span> (Π-intro), <code data-start="4482" data-end="4487">Pop</code> is application, <code data-start="4504" data-end="4511">Merge</code> ≡ pair <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">_</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">_</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\_,\_)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.06em; vertical-align: -0.31em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">_</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">_</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> and hence a Σ-intro; use <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_1,\pi_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> as eliminations for <code data-start="4592" data-end="4599">Merge</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4601" data-end="4635">
<p data-start="4603" data-end="4635"><code data-start="4603" data-end="4609">Nest</code> is sugar for application.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4637" data-end="4661"><strong data-start="4637" data-end="4661">Meta-theory (sketch)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4662" data-end="4918">
<li data-start="4662" data-end="4741">
<p data-start="4664" data-end="4741"><strong data-start="4664" data-end="4686">Substitution lemma</strong> and <strong data-start="4691" data-end="4712">subject reduction</strong> hold by standard CoC proofs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4742" data-end="4918">
<p data-start="4744" data-end="4918">Simply-typed (non-recursive) fragments are <strong data-start="4787" data-end="4811">strongly normalizing</strong>; with full CoC, normalization holds under usual constraints (no impredicative “Type:Type” collapse, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4920" data-end="4923">
<h1 data-start="4925" data-end="4987">4. World-dependent hazards and outcomes (deterministic core)</h1>
<p data-start="4989" data-end="5148">Let a <strong data-start="4995" data-end="5009">world type</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W:\mathsf{Type}_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>. Let a two-point <strong data-start="5049" data-end="5065">outcome type</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O:\mathsf{Type}_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> with constructors <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">S</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">a</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">f</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi>O</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">m</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Safe}:\!O,\ \mathsf{Doom}:\!O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Safe</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: -0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Doom</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: -0.1667em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span></span></span></span>.</p>
<p data-start="5150" data-end="5195">A <strong data-start="5152" data-end="5170">reason/channel</strong> is a dependent function:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R \;:\; \Pi w{:}W.\, O .</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5227" data-end="5311">A <strong data-start="5229" data-end="5250">bundle of reasons</strong> is a (finite) Σ-fold (right-nested pairs) of such functions:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">R</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⋯</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">U</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">n</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R} \;:\; \Sigma R_1{:}(\Pi w{:}W.\,O).\; \Sigma R_2{:}(\Pi w{:}W.\,O).\;\cdots\Sigma R_n{:}(\Pi w{:}W.\,O).\ \mathsf{Unit}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">R</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Unit</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5451" data-end="5483">Define a <strong data-start="5460" data-end="5482">folded disjunction</strong>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">O</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">O</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">m</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">m</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">O</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">S</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">a</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">f</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
\mathsf{Or} &amp;: O \to O \to O\\
\mathsf{Or}(\mathsf{Doom},y) &amp;= \mathsf{Doom},\quad \mathsf{Or}(\mathsf{Safe},y)=y.
\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3em; vertical-align: -1.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">Or</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">Or</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Doom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.75em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span></span></span><span style="top: -2.41em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Doom</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">Or</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Safe</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">y</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.25em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5635" data-end="5666">Typed <strong data-start="5641" data-end="5649">fold</strong> (deterministic):</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">F</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">l</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">d</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">O</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.8em" maxsize="1.8em">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>S</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.8em" maxsize="1.8em">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{FoldOr} : \Big(\Sigma R{:}\Pi w{:}W.\,O.\;S\Big)\to W \to O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">FoldOr</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.8em; vertical-align: -0.65em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size2">(</span></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">:</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size2">)</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5741" data-end="5907">where <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span></span></span> is a recursively defined tail of the Σ-list. Its eliminator recurses by <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_1,\pi_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, applying <code data-start="5851" data-end="5855">Or</code> across components after evaluating each <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_i\ w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span></span></span></span>.</p>
<p data-start="5909" data-end="6047">This recovers the purely logical <strong data-start="5942" data-end="5962">disjunctive doom</strong>: if any <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_i\,w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span></span></span></span> reduces to <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Doom}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Doom</span></span></span></span></span>, the fold returns <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">o</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Doom}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Doom</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
<hr data-start="6049" data-end="6052">
<h1 data-start="6054" data-end="6125">5. Probabilistic extension (typed) for <strong data-start="6095" data-end="6114">world-dependent</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_i(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></h1>
<p data-start="6127" data-end="6271">We add a <strong data-start="6136" data-end="6164">distribution type former</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Dist}(A) : \mathsf{Type}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Dist</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2175em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> for each <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A:\mathsf{Type}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2175em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, together with monadic operations:</p>
<ul data-start="6273" data-end="6430">
<li data-start="6273" data-end="6329">
<p data-start="6275" data-end="6329"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">u</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">r</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">n</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{return} : \Pi A.\, A \to \mathsf{Dist}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5714em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">return</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Dist</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6330" data-end="6430">
<p data-start="6332" data-end="6430"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">b</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">n</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">d</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">D</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">i</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">s</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{bind} : \Pi A,B.\, \mathsf{Dist}(A) \to (A \to \mathsf{Dist}(B)) \to \mathsf{Dist}(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">bind</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mord">.</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Dist</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Dist</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mclose">))</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Dist</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6432" data-end="6660">We also add <strong data-start="6444" data-end="6468">probabilistic choice</strong> at the term level. Reals, intervals, and constraints can be modeled with a base <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">R</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">a</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">l</mi></mrow><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">T</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">y</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">p</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Real}:\mathsf{Type}_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Real</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9386em; vertical-align: -0.2441em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Type</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.207em;"><span style="top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2441em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> and a refinement <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">R</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">e</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">a</mi><mi mathvariant="sans-serif">l</mi></mrow><mo>∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex"> [0,1] := \{ p:\mathsf{Real}\mid 0\le p \wedge p\le 1\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">]</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathsf">Real</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7804em; vertical-align: -0.136em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≤</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.75em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">