</li>
<li data-start="13348" data-end="13498">
<p data-start="13350" data-end="13498"><strong data-start="13350" data-end="13377">Normalization boundary:</strong> keep the dependent core (Π, Σ) strongly normalizing; isolate probabilistic effects in <code data-start="13464" data-end="13470">Dist</code> so meta-theory stays clean.</p>
</li>
