</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2218" data-end="2319">That JSON can be consumed by <strong data-start="2247" data-end="2259">three.js</strong>, <strong data-start="2261" data-end="2273">d3-force</strong>, or <strong data-start="2278" data-end="2291">pythreejs</strong> for 3D interactive layouts.</p>
