eak-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="156">Perfect — here’s a <strong data-start="19" data-end="35">clean module</strong> that bundles both the <strong data-start="58" data-end="73">2D plotting</strong> and the <strong data-start="82" data-end="97">JSON export</strong> into your existing Spherepop Calculus (SPC) interpreter.</p>
