<h3 data-start="2896" data-end="2912">How it works</h3>
<ul data-start="2913" data-end="3504">
<li data-start="2913" data-end="3089">
<p data-start="2915" data-end="3089"><strong data-start="2915" data-end="2930"><code data-start="2917" data-end="2928">draw_term</code></strong><br data-start="2930" data-end="2933">
