<h3 data-start="1487" data-end="1497">Effect</h3>
<ul data-start="1498" data-end="1675">
<li data-start="1498" data-end="1553">
<p data-start="1500" data-end="1553"><strong data-start="1500" data-end="1512">Step All</strong>: still jumps instantly to normal form.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1554" data-end="1675">
<p data-start="1556" data-end="1675"><strong data-start="1556" data-end="1571">Animate All</strong>: plays through every reduction with a fast, visible sequence, like bubbles popping one after another.</p>
</li>
</ul>
