<ul data-start="5892" data-end="6067">
<li data-start="5892" data-end="5943">
<p data-start="5894" data-end="5943"><strong data-start="5894" data-end="5918">Speed control slider</strong> (50–1000 ms per step).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5944" data-end="5995">
<p data-start="5946" data-end="5995"><strong data-start="5946" data-end="5961">Speed label</strong> updates as you drag the slider.</p>
