<hr data-start="2940" data-end="2943">
<p data-start="2945" data-end="3186">This gives you a <strong data-start="2962" data-end="2986">formal core calculus</strong> for SPC: syntax, typing, reduction rules, and probabilistic extension — compact enough for a paper, but extensible toward the richer semantics we prototyped in Python and the interactive HTML demo.</p>
<hr data-start="3188" data-end="3191">
