<hr data-start="2318" data-end="2321">
<p data-start="2323" data-end="2338">This gives you:</p>
<ul data-start="2340" data-end="2500">
<li data-start="2340" data-end="2374">
<p data-start="2342" data-end="2374"><strong data-start="2342" data-end="2357">BNF grammar</strong> for SPC terms.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2375" data-end="2438">
<p data-start="2377" data-end="2438"><strong data-start="2377" data-end="2393">Typing rules</strong> in natural deduction style (<code data-start="2422" data-end="2434">mathpartir</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2439" data-end="2500">
<p data-start="2441" data-end="2500"><strong data-start="2441" data-end="2464">Reduction semantics</strong> for Pop, Nest, Choice, and Merge.</p>
</li>
</ul>
