<p data-start="4282" data-end="4436">This way, your paper now clearly shows both <strong data-start="4326" data-end="4345">internal choice</strong> (simpler, lightweight) and the <strong data-start="4377" data-end="4409">distribution monad semantics</strong> (denotationally strong).</p>
<p data-start="4438" data-end="4539">Do you want me to also sketch a <strong data-start="4470" data-end="4503">denotational semantics clause</strong> for <code data-start="4508" data-end="4516">Choice</code> under Option B, i.e.</p>
