</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% Denotational Semantics (Option B: Distribution Monad)</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% =========================</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% Semantic domains</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">%   Objects/types A interpret to objects ⟦A⟧ in the topos  𝔼 := [Sphere^{op}, Set].</span></span><span>
