<hr data-start="1705" data-end="1708">
<p data-start="1710" data-end="1938">This table makes clear that SPC <strong data-start="1742" data-end="1754">inherits</strong> λ-calculus’ abstraction, <strong data-start="1780" data-end="1791">borrows</strong> from π-calculus’ parallelism, <strong data-start="1822" data-end="1833">extends</strong> probabilistic λ-calculi with categorical semantics, and <strong data-start="1890" data-end="1898">adds</strong> its own geometric/scoping innovation.</p>
