For independent hazards </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{Choice}(p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathsf</span></span><span>{Doom},</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathsf</span></span><span>{Safe})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
define the SPC term
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>n </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\;</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\;</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{FoldOr}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{Merge}(R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>1,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dots</span></span><span>,R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>n)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>).
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
Under independence,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Pr</span></span><span>[T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>n=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathsf</span></span><span>{Doom}] </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\;</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\;</span></span><span> 1 - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\prod</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i=1}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>n (1-p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i),
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
as established in the Independent-Channels Lemma; denotationally, this is the pushforward of the product distribution through the Boolean
disjunction </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathsf</span></span><span>{anyDoom}:O</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>n</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> O</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
