<p data-start="1416" data-end="1427">This way:</p>
<ul data-start="1428" data-end="1681">
<li data-start="1428" data-end="1515">
<p data-start="1430" data-end="1515">The column headers are shorter (<code data-start="1462" data-end="1479">$\lambda$-calc.</code> instead of <code data-start="1491" data-end="1511">$\lambda$-calculus</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1516" data-end="1620">
<p data-start="1518" data-end="1620">Long words like “communication” → “comm.”, “probabilistic” → “prob.”, “distribution” → “Dist.”, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1621" data-end="1681">
<p data-start="1623" data-end="1681">Everything fits comfortably once scaled to <code data-start="1666" data-end="1678">\textwidth</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
